  "_comment": "Ported from projects/harness_validation/photoreal_research/photoreal_impl/05_materials (prototype 2026-10-03, swim + scale tests passed). Texture sets name studio library assets (library/assets/<asset_id>); maps name manifest roles, never file paths. Kind-name special cases of the prototype (painted/cast-iron micro height, cast-iron pits, aluminium streaks) are explicit parameters here.",
