    "rad_per_px": 0.00036,
    "_rad_per_px": "Angular size of one output pixel. 50 mm lens, 36 mm sensor across the 1920 px long side of a 1080x1920 reel: 2*atan(18/50)/1920. Longer lenses make pixels smaller, so this default fades detail slightly early for telephoto shots (safe direction).",
