    "zero_px": 2.0,
    "_px": "A procedural feature of size s metres keeps full contrast while it spans >= full_px pixels and is faded to its mean once it spans <= zero_px pixels (Nyquist). Thin members far from camera otherwise shimmer / read as fully edge-worn."
